    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is already possible via [`config.window.config`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e50cf9de614500a20e47cfc50e30a100042f91c3/doc/mini-notify.txt#L123). The `\"solid\"` border can be achieved with this set up:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.notify').setup({ window = { config = { border = 'solid' } } })\r\n```",
